From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 23:05:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 58/69] soc: qcom: pd-mapper: Add SM7250

SM7250 has the same protection domains as SM6350, among them the modem's
WLAN PD that ath10k needs.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
---
 drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_pd_mapper.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_pd_mapper.c b/drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_pd_mapper.c
index 64ca99d7f..890fc8262 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_pd_mapper.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_pd_mapper.c
@@ -655,6 +655,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_pdm_domains[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm6350", .data = sm6350_domains, },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm7150", .data = sm7150_domains, },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm7225", .data = sm6350_domains, },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm7250", .data = sm6350_domains, },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm7325", .data = sc7280_domains, },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8150", .data = sm8150_domains, },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8250", .data = sm8250_domains, },
